        "His vague remark that he would \"not make unreasonable directives\" instead drew suspicion that he was leaving open the possibility of dropping the charges.",
        "The politically motivated cancellation of charges in an incumbent president's case could constitute an unconstitutional act that undermines the criminal justice system."
